sequenceDiagram
    actor Courier
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant Photos as Photo store
    participant DB as Postgres

    Courier->>Orders: POST /{orderId}/collect with photo
    Note over Orders: assigned courier, ACCEPTED, collection window still open
    Orders->>Photos: store JPEG, PNG, or WebP
    Orders->>DB: COLLECTED, acknowledgement deadline is delivery deadline plus 1 day
    Orders-->>Courier: 200 COLLECTED

    Courier->>Orders: POST /{orderId}/deliver with photo
    Note over Orders: assigned courier, COLLECTED, before the delivery deadline
    Orders->>Photos: store delivery photo
    Orders->>DB: DELIVERED, status outbox, rating.permission.granted
    Note over DB: courier may rate the requester
    Orders-->>Courier: 200 DELIVERED
